  "gh:content": {
    "en": "---\nKaede: “The hearing is carried over—no answer yet. But for him tonight, ‘no answer’ is the key.”\nHibiki: “Roads are wet, scattering glare. Pedestrian flows are being auto-redrawn. Return path is safe.”\nNei-chan: “Tama, now.”",
    "ja": "---\nKaede「公聴会は継続審議。答えは出てない——でも今夜の彼には、『答えがない』が鍵」\nHibiki「路面、雨で拡散。歩行者導線が自動で引き直されてる。戻りの安全は確保」\nNei-chan『タマ、いまのうちに』"
  },
  "gh:index": 1
}